
                       ###################################
                       Groovy-based Shell for Use with FFE
                       ###################################

        In order to build the FFE shell, run the commands in the script
        "console.make" after setting up the groovy compiler. The groovy
        distribution for version 2.2.4 is in other/groovy.

        Console classes must be compiled and installed in the "target"
        directory via "console.make" before building the rest of FFE.

        Warnings about illegal reflective access operations can safely
        be  ignored, for now.

